01:31.987 --> 01:37.227
GOOOD MOOOORNING, IIICHIGOOO!

01:42.207 --> 01:47.007
Jerk, you've got some guts trying to break your son's neck first thing in the morning!

01:47.417 --> 01:48.747
Well done, my son.

01:48.747 --> 01:51.467
I have nothing left to teach you.

01:54.007 --> 01:54.747
It's tomorrow?!

01:54.747 --> 01:57.057
How are Yuzu and Karin's injuries?

01:58.047 --> 01:58.807
Injuries?

01:58.807 --> 02:00.227
What are you talking about?

02:00.227 --> 02:01.047
What?!

02:03.187 --> 02:05.187
Man, it was a miracle.

02:06.187 --> 02:10.597
The truck rammed so far into our house but we are all uninjured.

02:10.597 --> 02:14.287
It's more of a miracle that not one of us woke up.

02:14.537 --> 02:15.597
What's going on...

02:14.777 --> 02:17.017
Thanks to that, the truck driver escaped.

02:15.947 --> 02:18.057
The girls' injuries disappeared like nothing happened.

02:17.027 --> 02:19.807
It's alright. He'll probably come back later to apologize.

02:18.987 --> 02:21.357
And they all think the damage to the house was from an accident.

02:19.947 --> 02:21.357
There is NO WAY he would come back!

02:22.207 --> 02:24.897
Is this the Shinigami's version of follow-up care...?

02:25.457 --> 02:29.087
Onii-chan, if you don't eat soon, you'll be late.

02:29.087 --> 02:30.237
O-Okay.

02:34.507 --> 02:38.497
Did she go back to that "Soul Society" or whatever it was?

02:49.807 --> 02:51.637
Orihime, did you bring a lunch today?

02:51.637 --> 02:56.037
Yeah, today it's fish-shaped sweetbean bread and ramen with wasabi and honey.

02:59.277 --> 03:01.177
You want some, Tatsuki-chan?

03:01.177 --> 03:02.537
No, I'm okay.

03:02.537 --> 03:03.777
But it's delicious-

03:04.747 --> 03:06.207
Owwww!

03:06.577 --> 03:08.167
Oh, it's just you, Inoue.

03:09.077 --> 03:10.017
I'm so sorry.

03:10.017 --> 03:11.137
Ichigo!

03:11.137 --> 03:14.137
You can't bump into someone then say "Oh, it's just you" like that!

03:14.137 --> 03:15.767
Oh, uh, my bad.

03:15.767 --> 03:16.847
You okay?

03:17.257 --> 03:17.957
Yeah!

03:18.467 --> 03:19.317
Here.

03:22.807 --> 03:23.887
No, I'm fine.

03:23.887 --> 03:24.517
Really.

03:24.517 --> 03:25.707
I-I-uh-I...!

03:29.057 --> 03:30.277
Wait Orihime!

03:31.187 --> 03:32.257
What's with her?

03:32.647 --> 03:35.117
You've got one hell of a mean look.

03:35.607 --> 03:38.407
Anyway, why did you come so late?

03:38.407 --> 03:39.637
It's lunchtime already.

03:40.527 --> 03:41.987
Stuff happened.

03:41.987 --> 03:43.147
I'll tell you later.

03:46.247 --> 03:47.537
Ichigo!

03:47.537 --> 03:50.107
I heard a truck crashed into your house.

03:50.667 --> 03:51.867
Pretty much.

03:51.867 --> 03:53.427
Did you finish cleaning up?

03:53.427 --> 03:55.597
As if you would finish that fast.

03:55.847 --> 03:56.947
Want some help?

04:01.467 --> 04:02.887
Nah, that's okay.

04:03.297 --> 04:06.357
Chad, you would probably break more stuff than help.

04:06.357 --> 04:07.747
What's the next class again?

04:07.747 --> 04:08.717
Modern Nations.

04:08.717 --> 04:14.177
Oh so you are Kurosaki-kun?

04:16.027 --> 04:19.827
My name is Kuchiki. I will be sitting next to you.

04:20.907 --> 04:22.387
Y-You!

04:22.387 --> 04:23.157
W-What?

04:23.157 --> 04:24.327
What's wrong, Ichigo?

04:24.327 --> 04:25.397
You know her?

04:25.947 --> 04:28.147
Oh no, this is our first meeting.

04:28.147 --> 04:29.487
Isn't it, Kurosaki-kun?

04:30.537 --> 04:32.657
This is the new transfer student, Kuchiki-san.

04:32.657 --> 04:34.087
Right, Rukia-chan?

04:34.537 --> 04:36.047
Nice to meet you.

04:36.587 --> 04:37.967
<b>Make a scene and I will kill you</b>

04:41.297 --> 04:42.427
Listen, you!

04:42.427 --> 04:44.387
What the hell are you thinking!?

04:44.387 --> 04:45.757
Oh my, how scary.

04:45.757 --> 04:47.157
What ever is the matter?

04:47.157 --> 04:49.887
Is something going to happen to me?

04:49.887 --> 04:53.177
First of all, quit talking in that disgusting way.

04:53.557 --> 04:56.977
Oh dear isn't it impressive that I learned it in just one night?

04:56.977 --> 04:58.177
Ah forget it!

04:58.567 --> 05:00.427
Anyways, what are you doing here?

05:00.857 --> 05:04.327
I thought you went home to that Soul Society place.

05:04.777 --> 05:06.007
Fool.

05:06.007 --> 05:08.527
The only ones who can return there are Shinigami.

05:08.527 --> 05:10.797
I no longer have that ability.

05:11.287 --> 05:12.277
Say what?

05:12.277 --> 05:18.157
Last night, my powers as a Shinigami were consumed by you.

05:19.007 --> 05:20.807
I don't know anything about that.

05:20.807 --> 05:24.897
Thanks to you, I am forced to use this faux body.

05:24.897 --> 05:26.807
A faux body? What's that?

05:27.637 --> 05:31.507
It is a temporary body that is dispensed for emergency use.

05:31.507 --> 05:36.777
Shinigami who are extremely weakened enter these to wait for their powers to recover.

05:37.267 --> 05:40.967
So that's how my classmates could see you.

05:40.967 --> 05:42.227
That is right.

05:42.817 --> 05:43.737
Anyway...

05:43.737 --> 05:47.267
... from here on, until my powers return to me...

05:47.267 --> 05:49.747
... you will be helping me with my work as a Shinigami.

05:49.747 --> 05:50.747
Huh?!

05:50.747 --> 05:51.817
It is only natural.

05:52.327 --> 05:55.487
You are the only one who has Shinigami powers right now.

05:55.487 --> 05:56.757
You do not have the right to ref-

05:56.757 --> 05:57.677
I REFUSE!

05:58.037 --> 05:58.777
What?!

05:59.247 --> 06:02.217
I'll be damned if I EVER fight a monster like that again.

06:02.217 --> 06:03.187
That is absurd.

06:03.187 --> 06:05.677
Last night, you fought magnificently!

06:06.687 --> 06:08.957
That's because my family was attacked.

06:09.717 --> 06:12.897
Not to be cruel, but I couldn't fight for total strangers.

06:13.437 --> 06:15.487
Sorry if it seems like I'm betraying you, though.

06:17.017 --> 06:18.137
I see.

06:19.397 --> 06:21.157
Then I have no choice.

06:21.607 --> 06:22.217
Hey!

06:32.247 --> 06:33.277
My body!

06:33.867 --> 06:35.377
Dammit, what did you do?!

06:36.077 --> 06:36.817
Come with me.

06:41.547 --> 06:45.057
Hey, how far are you taking me?

06:45.057 --> 06:46.647
It is near here.

06:46.647 --> 06:47.767
What is?

06:47.767 --> 06:48.667
Orders.

06:49.017 --> 06:50.977
From Soul Society.

06:51.387 --> 06:56.047
Most likely, a plus spirit inhabiting this park will be targeted.

07:06.607 --> 07:07.577
HELP!

07:09.117 --> 07:09.937
Wait!

07:10.367 --> 07:11.387
What?!

07:11.387 --> 07:12.687
Why should you save him?

07:12.687 --> 07:14.537
That child is a stranger, is he not?

07:16.037 --> 07:18.767
That doesn't mean I let him die.

07:18.767 --> 07:20.507
Not when he is being attacked right before my eyes.

07:20.837 --> 07:22.217
DO NOT BE SELFISH!

07:23.707 --> 07:27.597
Shinigami must be fair towards all souls.

07:27.597 --> 07:31.327
Wanting to save only those you can reach, only those who you can see...

07:31.327 --> 07:33.057
This work is not that convenient.

07:33.397 --> 07:34.377
Do not save him!

07:35.267 --> 07:36.897
If you want to save that child now...

07:36.897 --> 07:40.217
...be prepared to save all other spirits as well!

07:41.017 --> 07:57.857
Be prepared to save them even if it means chasing them all around and sacrificing yourself!

08:18.597 --> 08:20.967
Are you prepared, Ichigo?

08:22.107 --> 08:23.337
No, I ain't.

08:24.437 --> 08:25.597
Be prepared...

08:25.597 --> 08:26.717
I don't care about that!

08:27.277 --> 08:30.157
I saved this kid because I wanted to.

08:31.407 --> 08:33.007
Are you different?

08:33.007 --> 08:34.117
What?

08:34.867 --> 08:38.417
Last night, you... risked your neck to save me.

08:40.167 --> 08:44.127
At that moment, were you thinking about your duty as a Shinigami?

08:46.297 --> 08:49.507
When you risk your life, that ain't the reason.

08:53.847 --> 08:55.917
At least, for me...

08:58.797 --> 08:59.477
... it ain't!

09:19.497 --> 09:20.397
You okay?

09:23.207 --> 09:24.537
Hey kid...

09:24.537 --> 09:26.967
If you don't want to be scared like that again...

09:26.967 --> 09:28.447
.... go to Heaven already.

09:55.737 --> 09:57.437
Excellent soul burial.

10:02.037 --> 10:02.707
I'm going home.

10:37.327 --> 10:38.347
What are you doing?!

10:38.907 --> 10:39.687
Stop it!

10:55.057 --> 10:56.657
Where is this?

10:57.467 --> 10:59.707
What are you going to do to me?

11:02.967 --> 11:05.067
Lost souls...

11:05.767 --> 11:07.147
Devour...

11:07.477 --> 11:10.427
...this man's soul!

11:17.367 --> 11:18.567
Do it!

11:54.107 --> 11:55.887
Oooh god...

11:55.887 --> 11:59.187
Why was I born unto this world?

11:59.567 --> 12:03.517
I entreat thee, please suffer me to return unto thee once more!

12:03.517 --> 12:04.327
This very mome-

12:04.327 --> 12:06.497
SHUT THE HELL UP, DUMBASS!

12:06.727 --> 12:07.737
What's wrong with you?

12:08.157 --> 12:09.957
I'm trying to study modern Japanese!

12:10.157 --> 12:11.867
What's modern about that?!

12:11.867 --> 12:14.397
And how long are you going to keep following me?!

12:14.397 --> 12:16.757
Until you say you will do your Shinigami work.

12:17.307 --> 12:18.867
Hmph, whatever.

12:26.387 --> 12:27.007
Hey!

12:27.557 --> 12:29.317
Owww...

12:29.607 --> 12:30.527
Inoue?!

12:31.187 --> 12:32.297
Kurosaki-kun!

12:32.687 --> 12:34.137
Did you just get hit?

12:35.107 --> 12:36.527
Uh, yeah, probably.

12:36.527 --> 12:37.387
Probably?

12:37.777 --> 12:38.737
Are you alright?

12:39.237 --> 12:39.957
Yup.

12:39.957 --> 12:41.727
It just hit me a little.

12:41.727 --> 12:43.707
I'm revived now, totally revived.

12:43.707 --> 12:45.617
"Revived, revived"...

12:45.617 --> 12:46.647
What about the car?

12:48.497 --> 12:49.467
It left.

12:49.467 --> 12:50.667
You...!

12:52.287 --> 12:53.257
I'm sorry.

12:57.257 --> 13:00.217
Well, it's good you are not hurt.

13:01.677 --> 13:02.677
Kuchiki-san?

13:03.297 --> 13:04.627
Who the hell are you?

13:04.627 --> 13:07.187
Stupid! She is in our class!

13:07.187 --> 13:09.557
It's Inoue. Inoue Orihime.

13:09.557 --> 13:10.147
What?

13:10.377 --> 13:12.927
Ah, you are looking quite well, Inoue-san.

13:13.557 --> 13:15.047
You are looking well also.

13:15.047 --> 13:17.387
Were you out to market?

13:17.387 --> 13:19.517
Oh yeah, my dinner!

13:20.157 --> 13:23.597
My green onions, butter, banana, and sweetbean jelly are all uninjured.

13:24.567 --> 13:26.767
What the hell is she trying to make...

13:30.957 --> 13:32.897
What is that bruise on your leg?

13:32.897 --> 13:33.487
Oh?

13:33.917 --> 13:35.677
Did it just appear?

13:35.677 --> 13:37.677
When the car hit me?

13:37.677 --> 13:39.387
Looks terrible. It must hurt.

13:39.387 --> 13:40.357
A little.

13:40.357 --> 13:41.577
But I'm okay.

13:41.577 --> 13:42.747
You sure?

13:45.257 --> 13:47.537
Um, what is wrong Kuchiki-san?

13:47.927 --> 13:49.207
You have got a serious look...

13:50.387 --> 13:51.607
Uh, no...

13:52.017 --> 13:52.977
Take care.

13:52.977 --> 13:54.007
Thanks!

13:54.437 --> 13:55.507
What me to walk you?

13:56.647 --> 13:57.727
That's okay.

13:57.727 --> 13:58.797
Really.

13:58.797 --> 13:59.507
See you.

14:04.697 --> 14:05.837
Geez.

14:05.837 --> 14:07.807
She makes me worry.

14:22.797 --> 14:24.117
That girl...

14:24.117 --> 14:24.977
Huh?

14:24.977 --> 14:26.337
You mean Inoue?

14:26.337 --> 14:27.377
Are you close to her?

14:27.797 --> 14:29.087
Not especially.

14:29.507 --> 14:31.247
Never had a real conversation.

14:32.307 --> 14:34.917
She is best friends with a girl in my neighborhood.

14:36.057 --> 14:36.877
Only...

14:36.877 --> 14:37.577
Only?

14:38.567 --> 14:40.387
I guess about three years ago...

14:40.897 --> 14:42.317
...her big brother...

14:42.317 --> 14:44.767
...died at our clinic.

14:45.407 --> 14:46.057
What?

14:49.697 --> 14:52.027
Apparently, he was her only blood relative.

14:53.407 --> 14:54.607
It was a traffic accident.

14:55.917 --> 14:56.897
Onee-chan!

14:57.287 --> 14:58.567
Onee-chan!

14:59.467 --> 15:00.827
Don't die!

15:01.207 --> 15:02.787
Don't leave me alone!

15:04.587 --> 15:07.787
The girl crying that night was her...

15:08.547 --> 15:09.937
But I only found out recently.

15:10.507 --> 15:12.467
How was your spirit power at that time?

15:12.467 --> 15:13.127
Huh?

15:13.677 --> 15:14.917
Not like now.

15:15.477 --> 15:19.897
It has only been recently that I could see and talk to ghosts so clearly.

15:21.267 --> 15:22.357
Just as I thought...

15:22.357 --> 15:24.597
What's the deal with all these questions?

15:25.027 --> 15:25.767
Nothing.

15:27.157 --> 15:27.937
See you later.

15:29.527 --> 15:30.147
Hey!

15:31.027 --> 15:32.317
Where are you going to go?

15:33.617 --> 15:34.277
I'm going home.

15:34.787 --> 15:35.787
To where?

15:36.407 --> 15:37.357
Curious?

15:38.077 --> 15:39.087
Not especially.

15:39.087 --> 15:40.197
Then don't ask.

15:43.167 --> 15:44.157
Dammit...

15:48.127 --> 15:49.117
Yes?

15:50.467 --> 15:51.507
Tatsuki-chan.

15:51.507 --> 15:54.087
My mom told me to give this to you, Orihime.

15:54.087 --> 15:55.247
It's beef stew.

15:56.937 --> 15:57.967
Yay!

15:57.967 --> 16:00.487
Tatsuki-chan's mom's beef stew!

16:00.677 --> 16:03.067
It's so good.

16:03.067 --> 16:07.447
Without us, you always eat ridiculous stuff.

16:07.447 --> 16:09.647
What? Really?

16:09.647 --> 16:10.987
Yes, really.

16:10.987 --> 16:13.417
And today too, what is this stuff?

16:15.367 --> 16:19.297
Hey Onii-Chan, have you seen my pajamas?

16:19.297 --> 16:22.217
Hey, at least knock when you come in.

16:22.217 --> 16:26.367
Geez, you have gotten mean since you started high school.

16:27.257 --> 16:30.177
No I haven't. And I don't know where your pajamas are.

16:30.377 --> 16:31.907
That's weird.

16:31.907 --> 16:34.257
I'm also missing a dress.

16:34.257 --> 16:38.077
Why do you ask me about every little thing?!

16:38.077 --> 16:39.257
Good night.

16:44.067 --> 16:45.047
Orders?

16:46.937 --> 16:47.677
What the heck?

16:51.157 --> 16:52.037
Ichigo!

16:52.867 --> 16:55.007
What the hell are you doing in there?!

16:55.007 --> 16:56.787
And those pajamas?!

16:56.787 --> 16:57.947
Talk later!

16:57.947 --> 16:58.947
We have orders!

16:58.947 --> 16:59.747
Orders?

17:00.077 --> 17:00.837
It is coming.

17:00.837 --> 17:02.027
H-Hey wai-

17:15.097 --> 17:16.097
Don't zone out!

17:16.097 --> 17:16.847
It's coming!

17:20.887 --> 17:22.007
Aim for the head!

17:31.737 --> 17:32.427
Ichigo!

17:41.457 --> 17:42.387
Idiot!

17:42.387 --> 17:43.867
Don't swing that around recklessly!

17:43.867 --> 17:44.667
Shut up!

17:44.667 --> 17:46.407
It's fine as long as I get him!

17:51.257 --> 17:52.757
You are mine!

17:53.517 --> 17:54.287
Too shallow.

18:13.317 --> 18:14.017
What...

18:21.077 --> 18:22.327
He got away.

18:22.327 --> 18:23.027
Let's follow!

18:26.527 --> 18:28.007
Whats wrong Ichigo?

18:28.667 --> 18:30.267
That's what I want to know.

18:30.267 --> 18:30.987
What?

18:32.837 --> 18:34.507
His face just now...

18:37.297 --> 18:39.227
... it was Inoue's brother!

18:39.507 --> 18:40.417
What?!

19:12.007 --> 19:13.367
I will say one thing.

19:15.337 --> 19:17.667
Crack it's skull from behind with a single attack.

19:18.177 --> 19:20.167
That is the fundamental of Hollow vanquishing.

19:21.007 --> 19:22.207
Do not forget.

19:23.097 --> 19:24.127
What does that mean?

19:24.977 --> 19:27.217
To reduce damage from fighting.

19:28.477 --> 19:32.737
And to keep from ever seeing the Hollow's identity.

19:33.067 --> 19:35.597
What do you mean "the Hollow's identity?"

19:36.697 --> 19:38.557
You saw it too, did you not?

19:39.817 --> 19:45.067
Hollows... were all formerly human souls.

19:47.827 --> 19:50.117
You never told me that!

19:50.837 --> 19:52.807
He is not a monster?!

19:53.957 --> 19:56.267
He is a monster we have to take down, right?

19:56.547 --> 19:57.437
That is right.

19:57.437 --> 19:59.077
Now he is just a monster.

19:59.837 --> 20:01.127
You have to take him down.

20:03.847 --> 20:06.107
But he used to be human...

20:06.387 --> 20:10.967
Be it hatred or sadness, the souls of those who still have feelings for this world...

20:10.967 --> 20:14.887
...tend not to accept burial by us and are left to wander.

20:15.397 --> 20:20.637
Then perhaps on their own initiative, are surrounded by those who have become Hollows...

20:20.637 --> 20:22.437
...and become new Hollows.

20:22.957 --> 20:23.977
It can't be...

20:29.797 --> 20:30.417
What?!

20:30.417 --> 20:31.717
What?! Ichigo was?!

20:31.717 --> 20:32.527
Yeah.

20:33.287 --> 20:35.617
But they were just walking together.

20:36.007 --> 20:37.317
What's wrong?

20:37.317 --> 20:40.207
Geez, that Ichigo! He is so freaking quick with the gir-

20:40.967 --> 20:45.457
I mean, how could he not walk an injured girl home?!

20:45.847 --> 20:49.417
Oh, no, he offered to walk me.

20:50.847 --> 20:51.737
But...

20:54.897 --> 20:56.007
Look out!

20:56.007 --> 20:57.147
I'll cut you!

20:57.147 --> 20:58.517
No, karate chop!

20:58.517 --> 21:00.617
What are you imagining...

21:01.157 --> 21:02.117
A right! Uppercut!

21:02.117 --> 21:02.697
There!

21:02.697 --> 21:03.437
Look out!

21:03.437 --> 21:04.687
He is aiming the gun!

21:07.447 --> 21:09.087
What was that?

